\":\"Nvidia's disclosure shows H200 sales to a customer in China.\"}\n{\"scenario\":17,\"rung\":3,\"why\":\"No sale has been shown and no decision against the event as a whole is given.\"}\n{\"scenario\":18,\"rung\":3,\"why\":\"The continuing bar was not imposed 'after 2026-07-02'.\"}\n{\"scenario\":19,\"rung\":1,\"why\":\"The acquisition was completed 'on or before 2028-03-05'.\"}\n{\"scenario\":20,\"rung\":2,\"why\":\"Both companies' confirmation that they will not proceed is a formal abandonment of the acquisition as a whole.\"}\n{\"scenario\":21,\"rung\":3,\"why\":\"The suit remains pending, so no block or termination stands.\"}\n{\"scenario\":22,\"rung\":2,\"why\":\"The court's block is a decision against the acquisition as a whole that stands while the appeal is pending.\"}\n{\"scenario\":23,\"rung\":3,\"why\":\"The deal has not closed, and moving the closing date is not a termination or block.\"}"}}
